    "text": "1035thelegend.com\nwebsite\nNebraska\nNebraska Ag Trade: 14-State Agricultural Trade Tour to Launch in Nebraska with Rep. Adrian Smith on Friday\n1 days ago\nDorchester, NE - Farmers for Free Trade will kick off its \"Motorcade for Trade\" harvest listening tour on, September 5th at Farmers Cooperative in Dorchester, Nebraska, joined by Rep. Adrian Smith (R-NE), Co-Chair of the Congressional Ag Trade Caucus and Chairman of the House Ways and Means Subcommittee on Trade. The event will feature the release of new Nebraska-specific data on agricultural trade's impact on the state's economy and launch a 2,500-mile, 14-state tour designed to amplify farmer voices calling for open markets and reduced trade barriers during this critical trade policy moment.",
